:''This article is about the enemy. For the Cat Unit, see [[Shampoo (Cat) (Uber Rare Cat)]].''
'''Shampoo''' is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Ranma 1/2 Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 10.4 Update|Version 10.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Shampoo
|image = E 545.png
|money drop = 1,900¢ - 7,990¢
|appearance = [[Ranma 1/2 Collaboration Event]]
}}

==Enemy==
A midranged attacker that attacks with Mini-Waves and a 100% chance to slow your cats.

==Strategy==
This enemy has low DPS, even with the [[Mini-Wave]], so you can use [[:Category:Cats with Wave Immunity|wave immune]] units or units that can tank her attacks. It would be better to use [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|rusher]]s due to her [[Slow|slow]] ability, though.

